        "created_at": "2013-12-02T18:13:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mr Watson1974 is indeed referring to the First Appearance line in the official biography.</p><p>For the cards, all of the Vengeful Five, with the exception of Ermine, appeared in the base set:</p><p>Fright Train on Flak Cannon, Maintenance Level</p><p>Proletariat on Coolant Blast, Lead from the Front</p><p>Friction on Fleet of Foot</p><p>Ermine's first card was Rook City Wraith's incapacitated side, and her first appearance in a deck was on Isolated Hero in Miss Information's deck</p>",
